WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:07.140
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it’s this!

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.760
Our dragons are all together!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.300
Lua, yours is a Machine-Type.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.720
Be quiet.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:14.990
Sorry.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.270
What's that?  Don’t come near me!

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:34.620
We found this a few days ago among the 
remains of Arcadia Movement's headquarters.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:43.590
It shows that Arcadia Movement kidnapped 
children and did human experiments at the facility.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.560
Kidnapped children?  Human experiments?

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:53.200
My brother went to see you duel 
at the Daimon Area and died.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.430
Was he one of them?

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.120
The Public Maintenance Department 
is investigating the incident,

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.330
and this is strong evidence 
that will uncover the truth.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.380
Divine selected people with strong 
abilities to turn them into soldiers

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.100
that could even use their 
powers outside of duels.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:16.290
He was planning to send them into war zones.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:17.480
Aki…

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.940
You were among the chosen.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:29.160
Even if you try to turn away, 
it doesn’t change the truth!

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:33.980
Divine was only using 
you for your power, Aki!

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.290
Aki…

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.840
I was still fine with that.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:03.530
Divine took me in.

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:11.050
Even if he was just using me for my 
power, he was still irreplaceable to me.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:12.910
I know.

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:15.800
That’s fine.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.200
I won’t turn my back on you.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.400
No one has the right to 
turn their backs on you.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:27.730
The one sure thing is that I still 
believe in you, and I need you.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.590
Yusei…

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.330
We’re friends.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.090
Friends.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:55.670
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:55.930 --> 00:03:00.770
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:05.680
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:10.450
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:15.810
No matter how bad today is

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:20.800
There’s still the faintest light

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.200
All I have to do tomorrow

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:30.260
Is light it myself

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:35.270
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:40.240
Even if I get countless scars

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:46.540
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:50.520
Today will never exist again

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:56.420
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:25.290
Assemble!  Crimson Dragon Warriors!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:46.380
What a humongous mansion!  So 
this is Director Godwin’s home.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.710
I’ve been waiting for you.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.310
Welcome, Signers.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:05:02.710
It's been a long winding road, but I'm 
happy that I can finally welcome you.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.330
You’re always shady.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:09.790
Yusei, why are we here?

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:17.090
Godwin held your friends hostage to 
force you into entering the Fortune Cup.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:19.260
You trust him?

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:24.680
No, I won’t forgive Godwin 
for everything he’s done.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:29.460
But a mysterious event is 
threatening to destroy the world.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:33.050
The only person who knows 
the truth is Godwin.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:37.460
So you accepted his invitation 
in order to ask him about it.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.180
It's all I can do.

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:42.430
What do you want with us?

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:45.020
I don’t recall inviting you.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:49.510
C’mon, don’t be so harsh.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:52.280
Since you're not a Signer, 
I have no use for you.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.360
Please leave.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.650
I’m not coming without Lua!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.100
Luca…

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.690
Fine.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.020
Isn't that great, Lua?

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:09.370
Yeah…

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:14.720
I'll lead you inside.  This way, please.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.460
I wonder where we’re going.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:30.370
King, I took you there before.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:34.110
You're talking about someone 
else.  I'm no longer the King.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:40.030
Then from now on, I'll call you Jack Atlas.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.850
What?

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.490
This is…

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.350
That picture!

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.490
It’s the same as our marks!

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.170
Crimson Dragon...

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:13.770
That’s right.  This symbol of the Signers 
has been passed down as a legend among the stars.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:19.940
Luca!  And everyone too!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.960
Crimson Dragon…

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.930
Stardust Dragon attacks Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.830
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:43.670
Back then, we battled and wagered our pride 
in a Riding Duel at an empty Duel Stadium.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:47.140
However, that's when Crimson Dragon appeared.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.280
What?

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:57.420
That’s right.  Crimson Dragon 
guided you to Neo Domino City.

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:00.410
Crimson Dragon guided us?

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.930
No, this was all your plan!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:06.080
We battled and settled things on our own!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.660
Crimson Dragon has nothing to do with it!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:14.510
Crimson Dragon's power led you to that event.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:19.680
I'm only doing what Crimson Dragon wishes.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:23.390
You expect us to believe that?

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:27.150
It’s up to you whether you 
want to believe it or not.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:33.160
However, since you're Signers, 
you can't escape your destiny.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:34.260
Ever.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:38.260
My destiny as a Signer…

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.960
The more people were afraid 
of me, the more they hated me.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:52.470
Anger burned inside me, 
causing my power to grow.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:58.850
But if you didn’t have that power, 
you would never have met each other.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:06.590
That mark is a symbol given only 
to those chosen by Crimson Dragon.

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:13.720
The destiny of the Signers links 
and guides your individual fates.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.380
And Luca.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.370
It’s the same for you.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:21.840
My destiny as a Signer…

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:26.560
I had forgotten my childhood for a long time.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:33.040
My soul was in a different world.   It 
was living with Duel Monsters spirits.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.780
I'm done!  Here you go.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:38.640
I met Ancient Fairy Dragon in that world.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:44.160
I never thought what that 
strange meeting meant.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:44.180
I’ll stay here.  I'll protect you!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.820
But now I know.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:52.150
Rescuing Ancient Fairy Dragon is 
my destiny!  It’s my desire!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:56.770
I want to rescue Ancient Fairy 
Dragon and the spirit world!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.160
You cannot turn away.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:07.200
Since you have the same 
marks, you've been chosen

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:10.400
as the reincarnations of 
the legendary Signers.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.670
It doesn’t matter if you want it or not.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.850
You're at the mercy of destiny.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:21.980
It was decided thousands of years 
ago that you would meet again.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.210
Meet each other as Signers.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.640
It's our destiny.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.320
The light…

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:43.920
Haven’t you forgotten one important thing?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:47.100
Isn't there supposed to be five Signers?

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.560
That’s right.  Where's the last person?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.330
The last one is already awake.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:03.590
When you face real danger, that person 
will show up along with Crimson Dragon.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.640
What do you mean?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.610
You'll soon find out.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:22.060
Thousands of years ago, Crimson Dragon 
arrived and sealed away evil avatars into the ground.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:27.030
That seal was called the Nazca Lines.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:37.390
We were forbidden to tell outsiders 
about these facts.  And now…

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:47.150
There have been mysterious events 
where the Nazca Lines have vanished.

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.930
This is the work of the Dark Signers.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:52.920
Dark Signers…

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:59.240
Similar to you, they have the 
marks of the Dark Signers.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:05.090
They create a special field 
that's impossible to escape.

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:09.150
And the attacks are real.

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:17.650
They also have Dark Synchro Monsters.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:27.630
When shadow stacks on shadows, the door to the 
realm of the dead opens.  A world without light!

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.040
Dark Synchro!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:32.220
Come!  Frozen Fitzgerald!

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:38.240
Dark Synchro uses a Dark Tuner to Synchro 
Summon a negative Level monster.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.480
That duel defied logic.

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:46.700
That’s right.  If our duels 
are based on the power of life,

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:50.700
their duels are based on 
the power of the dead.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.720
Power of the dead?

00:12:53.720 --> 00:13:00.170
When the Dark Signers appear, 
so do the geoglyphs.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:06.810
Now that they're here, Neo Domino 
City is in a life-or-death situation.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:09.870
Yes, I’ve seen it with my own eyes.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:15.470
They sacrificed many people in Satellite!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.580
What?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.260
They were victims!

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:43.470
Their actions are beyond what I anticipated.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:49.680
The geoglyphs even appeared in the 
City, and there were many victims.

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:51.680
Just like I thought.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.710
What's that?

00:13:56.290 --> 00:14:02.150
What you saw at Satellite 
also occurred in the City.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:06.940
Due to the monsters that 
emerged from the geoglyphs,

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:11.840
several hundred people in the 
vicinity are currently missing.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.980
They're Earthbound Immortals!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:47.970
That’s right.  Earthbound Immortals 
are the gods of the Dark Signers.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:47.970
They're summoned by sacrificing humans.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:50.610
What happened to the people 
who were sacrificed?

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.700
I don’t know.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.400
These glasses…  Can it be?

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:05.310
Every moment is a battle.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:12.330
If you do nothing, City, Satellite and every 
citizen will fall into the hands of the Dark Signers.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:18.120
Neo Domino City will be destroyed, 
just like in your vision.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:25.370
When you say everyone 
in City and Satellite...

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:29.890
That also includes Tempei, Himuro and Yanagi?

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:33.450
You cannot avoid this battle.

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:37.480
Signers and Dark Signers represent 
the light and the dark.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:42.980
Only the Signers can defeat the 
Dark Signers and save everyone

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:47.080
in this life-or-death situation.  
There is no one else.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:57.150
My power caused people to hate me, so 
I never enjoyed living in the City.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.160
Because I’m a monster?

00:15:59.160 --> 00:15:59.950
However…

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:07.440
Aki, your father says that he accepts you.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.180
You have a home if you want it.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:14.930
You have to think for yourself 
and make a decision.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:22.490
My place… is here.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.430
Papa...  Mama…

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.370
Destiny doesn’t matter!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.330
Jack…

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:35.040
I'll decide what I need to do!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:43.920
Yusei, there are times when a man has 
to do impossible missions on his own.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:47.320
However, no matter how impossible the task,

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:51.790
your friends will help you as long 
as you believe in what you're doing.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.780
Martha's right.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:58.680
I won't win on my own because 
this battle won't be easy.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:03.560
Godwin, there's something 
else I have to ask you.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.970
What is it?

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:13.180
When I returned to Satellite, a former friend who I 
thought was dead appeared before me as a Dark Signer.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:18.040
So you’ve forgotten about me.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:24.990
No way!  Kiryu?

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:28.230
You’re alive, Kyosuke Kiryu?

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.330
Yusei, thanks to you, I’ve seen hell.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:37.300
I'll get my revenge until 
you can't stand it anymore!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:43.370
Kyosuke Kiryu used to be the 
leader of Jack and my duel team.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:49.070
He became a Dark Signer with fearsome power.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:54.770
Let's settle our destinies here!

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:57.760
Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:07.830
Next, Hundred-Eyes Dragon's 
monster effect activates!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.000
It gains the monster effect of Infernity 
Dwarf that's in my graveyard.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:14.940
His Hundred-Eyes Dragon 
had powerful abilities.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:21.330
Yes, but Kiryu’s real goal was to 
summon an even more frightening monster.

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:31.310
When Hundred-Eyes Dragon is destroyed, I 
select one card in my deck and add it to my hand.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:37.210
That’s when I learned that he 
gathered many Satellite citizens

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.030
in order to sacrifice them to his monster.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.830
I couldn't believe what I was seeing.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:49.910
It was hard to accept that Kiryu came 
into possession of such incredible power.

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:53.210
I sacrifice their souls.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:58.120
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:12.180
Earthbound Immortal Ccapac 
Apu wasn’t affected

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:16.160
by spells or traps and didn’t 
take monster attacks.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:18.330
It was an unbelievable monster.

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.900
Stardust!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:26.700
What?  Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:32.680
Damn!  I can't even defend 
with a monster or a trap!

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:39.540
If my D-Wheel didn’t malfunction 
and stop the duel, I would've died.

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:44.790
Why did Kiryu become a Dark Signer?

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:48.800
Answer us!  Who are the Dark Signers?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.560
It's better if you don’t know.

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:58.200
Stop messing around!  Yusei and I 
have to risk our lives in a duel

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:01.200
against a man we once considered a friend!

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:05.350
I'm willing to risk my life to 
protect the City and Satellite.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.910
However, if there’s a way to 
return Kiryu back to normal-

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:09.980
It’s impossible.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:17.850
There's no method to return the Dark Signers 
back to their former selves.  None.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.450
What do you mean?

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:26.000
Dark Signers are the souls of the 
dead that now have special abilities.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.680
In other words, they no longer exist.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.700
What?

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:35.500
They no longer exist?

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.930
What does that mean?

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.300
It can’t be…

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:43.280
Kiryu is already dead.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:47.850
That's nonsense!  The dead 
can't come back to life!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:54.730
There is a way.  An unbelievable phenomenon 
is occurring beyond the doors of the dead.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:21:01.690
Negative Level Dark Synchro Monsters 
represent the envoys of the afterlife.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:08.300
Destiny is moving.  We can no longer go back.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:16.920
Either you defeat the Dark Signers or this 
world dies with us.  It's all in your hands.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:25.830
Before giving me your answer, think 
carefully about what you should do.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:29.360
But there isn’t much time.

00:21:57.140 --> 00:22:01.610
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:06.680
We will build our own future

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:12.120
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:17.290
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:32.430
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:38.000
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:42.710
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:47.980
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:52.450
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:58.030
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.160 --> 00:23:02.840
This journey has no end

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:08.370
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:13.610
Hear my voice
